html='''<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Jackal shield restoration</title>
<style>[hidden]{display:none!important}body{max-width:1280px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 22px;background:#111923;color:#e8eef5;font:16px system-ui;line-height:1.5}h1{font-size:30px}button,select{font:inherit;background:#26394b;color:white;border:1px solid #52738d;padding:8px;margin:4px;cursor:pointer}a{color:#7bd9ff}.pair{display:flex;gap:16px}.pair figure{flex:1;margin:0;min-width:0}img{width:100%;image-rendering:pixelated}figcaption,.muted{color:#afc0d0}#single{max-width:900px;margin:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse}td,th{padding:9px 16px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #40505f}td:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12px}.note{border:1px solid #52738d;padding:14px}.roster{display:flex;gap:12px}.roster figure{margin:0;flex:1}</style>
<h1>Jackal shields — restoration appraisal</h1>
<p>The original 76-triangle shield is restored on Minor and Major Jackals at every body LOD. One shared rigid mesh follows the source forearm animation: 76 additional vertex loads per visible shield, with no extra animated vertex buffers.</p>
<p><a href="halo64-jackal-shields.z64">Playable Firefight ROM</a> · <a href="pixel-checks.json">Matched cameras and pixel checks</a> · <a href="results.json">Native profiles</a></p>
<select id="page"></select><button id="prev">Previous</button><button id="next">Next</button>
<div><button data-mode="pair">Before / restored</button><button data-mode="before">Before</button><button data-mode="after">Restored</button><button data-mode="diff">Difference ×4</button><button id="blink">Blink</button></div>
<h2 id="label"></h2><div class="pair" id="pair"><figure><figcaption>Previous roster: invisible shield</figcaption><img id="before"></figure><figure><figcaption>Restored source shield</figcaption><img id="after"></figure></div><div id="single" hidden><img id="one"></div><pre id="state"></pre>
<p class="muted">72 matched pages × four cameras at native 320×240: two ranks, three body LODs and twelve shield/animation/occlusion states. Actors are suspended for inspection. The same cameras and poses are used before and after. Near, middle and coarse meshes are deliberately shown at inspection distance.</p>
<div class="note"><strong>Verified:</strong> all 24 depleted pages are pixel-identical to the old renderer. Recharged shields match full strength outside the changing caption. Every rank/LOD passes opaque foreground and transmitted rear-actor detail checks. Production hit tests cover interception, exposed-body openings, overcharge depletion and recharge. Source recharge is a 15-second delay followed by immediate restoration, not a gradual fill.</div>
<h2>Original roster photo route</h2><p>All 46 original pages were repeated with a fresh shield-off control. All 35 opaque non-Jackal pages are pixel-identical; the three Jackal pages gain their shields. Eight cloaked-Elite pages retain the same poses and opacity settings but their noise-dither pixels differ; exact pixel identity is not claimed for those pages. <a href="roster-pixel-checks.json">Verification record</a>.</p>
<select id="rosterLod"><option value="12">Near Jackal</option><option value="13">Middle Jackal</option><option value="14">Coarse Jackal</option></select><div class="roster"><figure><figcaption>Before</figcaption><img id="rb"></figure><figure><figcaption>Restored</figcaption><img id="ra"></figure><figure><figcaption>Difference ×4</figcaption><img id="rd"></figure></div>
<h2>Fresh native performance</h2><div id="perf"></div><p class="muted">Ares v148, 8 MiB, NTSC 320×240, audio enabled, uncapped diagnostic ROMs. Each of 24 cases contains 45 observations, discarding five warm-up samples. Table means use at least one human and enemy alive with no arrival underway. Same scenarios do not guarantee identical live combat states. The playable ROM caps at 30 FPS. No new cartridge measurements are claimed.</p>
<h2>Source fidelity</h2><p>All 76 source faces, original UVs, two-sided rendering and the rigid forearm binding are retained. Minor blue and Major gold come from the source color-C parameters. The original physical shield, exposed-body gaps, damage, recharge, AI and scores are unchanged. All 230 sampled attachment poses match the source skinning within 0.00071 world units after vertex quantization.</p>
<p>The source's seven-stage animated additive shader is approximated with one noise-textured alpha pass. It tests opaque depth without writing depth and sorts shields back to front. Strength controls opacity and shield damage adds a short white flash; hits through exposed-body gaps do not restart that flash. This preserves translucency and rank identity; it does not reproduce the complete CE noise animation, additive glow or particle burst.</p>
<script>const D=__DATA__,$=x=>document.getElementById(x);let index=0,mode='pair',timer=null;const file=i=>String(i).padStart(2,'0')+'.png';D.labels.forEach((s,i)=>{let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=i;o.textContent=s;$('page').append(o)});function show(){$('label').textContent=D.labels[index];$('page').value=index;$('state').textContent=D.states[index];for(let k of ['before','after'])$(k).src=k+'/'+file(index);$('pair').hidden=mode!=='pair';$('single').hidden=mode==='pair';if(mode!=='pair')$('one').src=mode+'/'+file(index)}function stop(){clearInterval(timer);timer=null}document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{stop();mode=b.dataset.mode;show()});$('page').onchange=e=>{index=+e.target.value;show()};$('prev').onclick=()=>{index=(index+71)%72;show()};$('next').onclick=()=>{index=(index+1)%72;show()};$('blink').onclick=()=>{if(timer){stop();return}mode='before';show();timer=setInterval(()=>{mode=mode==='before'?'after':'before';show()},650)};function roster(){let f=file(+$('rosterLod').value);$('rb').src='roster-before/'+f;$('ra').src='roster-after/'+f;$('rd').src='roster-diff/'+f}$('rosterLod').onchange=roster;roster();
let t=document.createElement('table');t.innerHTML='<tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Players</th><th>Before FPS</th><th>Restored FPS</th><th>Change</th></tr>';for(let [suite,label] of [['ordinary','Ordinary opening'],['roster','Crowded new roster'],['control','Original crowded mix']])for(let n=1;n<=4;n++){let a=D.cases['before-'+suite+'-'+n].living_players_and_landed_enemies.fps_mean,b=D.cases['after-'+suite+'-'+n].living_players_and_landed_enemies.fps_mean,tr=document.createElement('tr');tr.innerHTML='<td>'+label+'</td><td>'+n+'</td><td>'+a.toFixed(2)+'</td><td>'+b.toFixed(2)+'</td><td>'+((b/a-1)*100).toFixed(1)+'%</td>';t.append(tr)}$('perf').append(t);show();</script>'''
